From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diep Tran <trancaodiepnct@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:56:53 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(F10-F15): wallet tabs, signed redeem token, redeem
 confirmation, refunds and reviews

- F10 (task 7): new WalletModule - GET /wallet?tab= (ACTIVE incl. REFUND_PENDING, expiry by expireAt)
  and GET /wallet/:id (owner only, 404 otherwise) with refund / review eligibility.
- F10 (task 8): QR payload v1.<nonce>.<expMs>.<sig> signed with REDEEM_HMAC_SECRET (no voucher id),
  unique 6-digit OTP from crypto.randomInt, max 10 tokens / 10 minutes per customer.
- F11 (task 11): server verifies the QR signature, locks token + voucher, conditional UPDATEs,
  consumes the token even on business failures, BusinessException with error.reason / error.details.
- F11 (task 14): BILL_REQUIRED for PREPAID vouchers (token kept), PATCH /redeem/logs/:id/bill within
  10 minutes, OTP lock 15 minutes after 5 wrong codes in 5 minutes (counted in audit_logs).
- F12 (task 15-16): RefundGateway (sandbox) with REFUND_MODE auto/manual, REFUND_PENDING -> COMPLETED /
  FAILED / MANUAL_PENDING, restock unless ENDED, DC-12 check, fail-manual endpoint, AuditLog.
- F15 (task 18): reviews by campaignId, public list with avgRating, eligibility, admin hide / unhide.
- Docs: README API contract, docs/demo-redeem.md (task 13), docs/wireframes.html (task 4-5).
- Tests: 90 unit, 78 e2e (29 new in test/voucher-usage.e2e-spec.ts).

Base: merge_code_v1 (be8334f), which already includes feature/F16-notify-redeem-refund_Viet
and feature/dat - apply on top of merge_code_v1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
